  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><h3>About our brand and products</h3><p><strong>Thinkle</strong> is a fast-paced word association card game designed to bring people together through laughter, creativity, and quick thinking. Perfect for families, parties, classrooms, and social gatherings, Thinkle is simple to learn and endlessly fun to play — making it a hit for players of all ages.</p><hr><h3>What makes us different</h3><p>Thinkle stands out because it’s <strong>easy to learn, fast to play, and incredibly social</strong>. There are no complicated rules or right or wrong answers — the goal is simply to think like everyone else. It’s the kind of game that creates instant connection and unforgettable moments at any gathering.</p><hr><h3>How affiliates can earn</h3><p>Affiliates earn commission on every sale generated through their referral links or discount codes. With a highly giftable product and strong appeal for families, game nights, and social events, Thinkle converts well across a wide range of audiences.</p><hr><h3>How to promote us</h3><p>Thinkle performs especially well through:</p><ul><li><p>Social media content (Instagram, TikTok, YouTube)</p></li><li><p>Game night or family lifestyle content</p></li><li><p>Gift guides and holiday recommendations</p></li><li><p>Product reviews and gameplay demonstrations</p></li></ul><p>Authentic demonstrations of the game in action often drive the highest engagement and conversions.</p></div>",
